	(text "System-5 bus backplane Rev D (S5BUS-D), one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Slots          EIGHT 36-PIN SLOTS, EVERY POSITION BUSSED\n  sheet 3  Pull-ups       10K PULL-UPS: D0-D7 (RN1) AND THE OPEN-COLLECTOR LINES (RN2)\n  sheet 4  Power          POWER IN, SWITCH, FUSE, REVERSE PROTECTION, BULK CAPACITOR, POWER LED\n\nRedrawn from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "57aeb6b1-63b2-52e8-956c-22beaef41b0c"))
